{"id": "xbe8y8e", "title": "Massive Landslide Tears Through Chame, Nepal!", "description": "A major landslide struck Chame in Nepal\u2019s Manang District on September 27, sending debris into the Marshyangdi River and partially blocking its flow. Local authorities warned communities downstream to remain on high alert as landsliding continued.\n\nDramatic videos linked to Chame have since spread widely online, appearing to show a huge section of mountainside collapsing. The exact origin of individual viral clips should be independently verified.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Disclaimer\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Disclaimer: This content is shared for news, informational and public-awareness purposes. Details may change as more information becomes available. Any footage, claims or reports that have not been independently verified should be treated with caution. We do not intentionally present unverified information as confirmed fact.\n#Nepal #Chame #Manang #Landslide #BreakingNews", "thumbnails": [{"height": 60, "id": "60", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/f4ZbE1gkko-flTm1C/x60"}, {"height": 120, "id": "120", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/f4ZbE1gkko-EDr3Jt/x120"}, {"height": 180, "id": "180", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/f4ZbE1gkko-ms3sSo/x180"}, {"height": 240, "id": "240", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/f4ZbE1gkko-5eFcdl/x240"}, {"height": 360, "id": "360", "url": "https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/f4ZbE1gkko-l9jBzQ/x360"}, {"height": 480, "id": "480", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/f4ZbE1gkko-0w_3YR/x480"}, {"height": 720, "id": "720", "url": "https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/f4ZbE1gkko-lcNfo-/x720"}, {"height": 1080, "id": "1080", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/f4ZbE1gkko-NQOVtM/x1080"}], "duration": 26, "timestamp": 1790635181, "uploader": "Global Brief", "uploader_id": "x4900yy", "age_limit": 0, "tags": [], "view_count": null, "like_count": 0, "formats": [{"format_id": "hls-0_aac_q1-_original_", "format_note": "(original), low", "format_index": null, "url": "https://vod3.cf.dmcdn.net/sec2(f3X8EJz39Achk67Vg